:"While independently reviewing ginux@82df3d71, I built libFuzzer harnesses for three untrusted-input surfaces and would like to offer them upstream:\n- crates/oci tar+PAX (parse plus the traversal APIs used by published_rootfs.rs): 41.0M execs, 93.2% regions\n- crates/protocol-state ARP/IPv4/ICMP: 247.1M execs, 97.5% regions\n- crates/volume-format sectors: 87.8M execs, 99.4% regions\n- a 15.3M-exec differential run of the PAX parser against the tar crate: all differences were fail-closed\nAll runs use ASan and overflow-checks, committed seeds and dictionaries; no crashes or sanitizer reports. Fuzzing only finds crashes, not logic bugs, so this is not a safety claim. The harnesses are in hafid-logic/ginux-watch (fuzz/) and consume upstream read-only at the pinned commit.\nWould you prefer them under fuzz/ or tests/? A draft PR can follow if useful.\n(AI-assisted analysis, reviewed by me.)","closed_by":{"login":"gmkurtzer","id":13984965,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/58/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"